    "detailed_description": "None of the hunters is able to fight them all and bring peace to the lands. They need a leader that can gather a party of heroic fighters to hunt these creatures in dungeons. Are you ready to become that hero, win honor in battles, and earn gold?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMain features:<br />\r\n* Discover a combination of RPG and clicker in one game;<br />\r\n* Gather a party of randomly generated fighters;<br />\r\n* Fight monsters in dungeons;<br />\r\n* Use fighters' skills in battles;<br />\r\n* Let your fighters use their skills automatically and just watch the battle,<br />\r\n* Or help them fight by choosing the right skill.",
